OL,3,GNEWSAMP seeks Burnham's support in
OL,4,Acancer reporting bill
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP's proposal that the government
OL,7,Freports to Parliament about the way it
OL,8,Fis tackling and preventing cancer will
OL,9,Fbe discussed later.
OL,11,FClive Jones, Wokingham's Liberal
OL,12,FDemocrat MP, wants information on
OL,13,F"specified targets and measures
OL,14,Frelating to cancer and to the
OL,15,Fprevention, diagnosis and treatment" of
OL,16,Fit to be provided annually.
OL,18,FJones was diagnosed with breast cancer
OL,19,Fin 2008 and he has appealed to prime
OL,20,Fminister Andy Burnham to support his
OL,21,Fprivate member's bill (PMB).
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
